{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"b1-practice-22","level":"B1","kind":"fill","title":{"de":"Essen und Trinken 3","bn":"খাবার ও পানীয় ৩"},"questions":[{"type":"gap","prompt":"Als ___ nehme ich Fisch mit Reis. (প্রধান খাবার)","answers":["Hauptgericht"],"options":["Hauptgericht","Fischgericht","Gasthaus"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-22-q1"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Heute esse ich ___. (গরুর মাংস)","answers":["Rindfleisch"],"options":["Rindfleisch","Geflügel","Hackfleisch"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-22-q2"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Für den Salat brauche ich ___. (জলপাই তেল)","answers":["Olivenöl"],"options":["Olivenöl","Getreide","Zitronat"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-22-q3"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Bitte achte auf das ___. (মেয়াদ উত্তীর্ণের তারিখ)","answers":["Haltbarkeitsdatum"],"options":["Haltbarkeitsdatum","Nahrungsmittel","Übergewicht"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-22-q4"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Zum Frühstück esse ich ___. (আস্ত শস্যের রুটি)","answers":["Vollkornbrot"],"options":["Vollkornbrot","Weißbrot","Wurstbrot"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-22-q5"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Hähnchen ist ___. (হাঁস-মুরগি)","answers":["Geflügel"],"options":["Geflügel","Rindfleisch","Getreide"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-22-q6"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Wir essen heute in einem kleinen ___. (সরাইখানা)","answers":["Gasthaus"],"options":["Gasthaus","Gemüseladen","Päckchen"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-22-q7"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Er trinkt zu viele ___ und hat Übergewicht. (মিষ্টি পানীয়)","answers":["Süßgetränke"],"options":["Süßgetränke","Weißbrote","Steaks"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-22-q8"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Wenn ich Zeit ___, würde ich mehr kochen.","answers":["hätte"],"options":["hätte","habe","hatte"],"promptBn":"কল্পনা: habe